   "sentenceId": 11,
   "he": "וְכֵן הַמָּשִׁיחַ. מְנָלַן? דִּכְתִיב: ״לְאַשְׁמַת הַעָם״, הֲרֵי מָשִׁיחַ כְּצִבּוּר.",
   "en": "The mishna continues: «And likewise the anointed» priest. The Gemara asks: «From where do we» derive this? It is derived from a verse, «as it is written» with regard to the anointed priest: “If the anointed priest shall sin «so as to bring guilt upon the people”» (Leviticus 4:3), indicating that the status of «an anointed» priest «is like» that of the general «public.»"
  }
